# 约定(2026-09-23 重写, 对齐 api/product/v1 的 proto):
#   直连 = http://{host}:{port}, 身份由 x-md-global-user-id 头模拟网关注入;
#   网关 = {gateway_scheme}://{gateway_host}(LAN) 或 https://{public_gateway_host}(公网), 带 Authorization: Bearer {token}。
#   变量在 http-client.env.json(dev)。host 用 [::1]: 127.0.0.1:30001/30002/30003 被 GoLand/WebStorm/JCEF 占着。

### healthz
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/healthz
Content-Type: application/json

### GetProductDetail(直连)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/product.v1.ProductService/GetProductDetail
Content-Type: application/json

{"spuCode": "{{spu_code}}"}

### GetProductDetail(不存在的 spuCode → not_found)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/product.v1.ProductService/GetProductDetail
Content-Type: application/json

{"spuCode": "no-such-spu"}

### GetProductDetail(LAN 网关)
POST {{gateway_scheme}}://{{gateway_host}}/product.v1.ProductService/GetProductDetail
Content-Type: application/json

{"spuCode": "{{spu_code}}"}
